  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Upgrade DV:</strong> DV 29<br>\n<strong>Cost:</strong> Cost #1: Cost of the Bodyweight Auto Injector Cyberware\n\nCost #2: 5,000eb<br>\n<strong>Thermometer:</strong> Partially replicates a Role ability.<br>\n<strong>Applies To:</strong> A Bodyweight Auto Injector<br>\n<strong>Vendor:</strong> Toaster</p>\n<p>A Medtech can load a dose of Speedheal in the Auto Injector. The Speedheal is injected into the user without needing an Action when the user becomes Seriously Wounded. This Cyberware can no longer be activated manually or be loaded with Street Drugs.</p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Bodyweight AutoInjector</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Price is Cost #2 only; Cost #1 is the cost of the Bodyweight AutoInjector.</li>\n<li>Not automated.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From Bontari Homebrew Cyberpunk Items by Bontari (Invented Tech Upgrades).</em></p>"
